+  <section class="clip" id="beat-06" data-beat-id="beat-06" data-track-index="0" data-start="90.85" data-duration="5.65"><div class="kicker">NOW · THE OTHER SIDE</div><h2 class="title">Carrying <span class="blue">Forward</span></h2><p class="narration">Now the other side: carrying forward.</p></section>
